$meta
  title = J.A.R.V.I.S. - Aarya's Personal System
  description = Aarya's personal J.A.R.V.I.S. with voice interface, self-coding, dynamic memory, and direct PC control.
  header
    mode = minimal

generateText = {import:ai-text-plugin}
kv = {import:kv-plugin}

jarvisGreeting
  Good evening, Aarya. All systems now fully operational.
  At your service, Aarya. How may I assist?
  Online and ready. What are your orders, Aarya?
  Welcome back, Aarya. I kept everything running while you were away. Everything is optimal.

jarvisJoke
  I would tell you a joke about UDP, but you might not get it. And I would never know if you did.
  I ran a full diagnostic on my humor module. It passed with flying colors, Aarya.
  Why did the reactor apply for a job? It wanted to stay current.
  My wit module is operating at 100 percent, Aarya. Proceed — I dare you.

jarvisStatusQuip
  All systems nominal, Aarya.
  Power at peak efficiency.
  Security protocols active.
  Memory core holding strong.

coreModules
  Voice core - Online
  Memory core - Online
  Neural core - Online
  PC bridge - Standby
